1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,900
San Lucas, Kapitulo 22

2
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,760
Itikasta na panakisao ni Judas kadagiti Panguluan Apapadi

3
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:39,000
kan kadagiti opisyalis dagiti Gwardya ti Templo

4
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:43,360
tap no makitulag no kasanuti panangyawat na kinesus kadakwada.

5
00:00:44,360 --> 00:00:47,460
Naragsakan dakat inkarida ng ikanda itikwarta.

6
00:00:48,540 --> 00:00:52,860
Imanamong ni Judas kat inrugina tinagbiro kitinasaya at nagundaway

7
00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:58,040
a panangyawat na kinesus kadakwada adi mamamuan dagiti tattaw.

8
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,880
Dimtang tialdao ti pesta ti tinapay na awan libadura na

9
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:08,300
a panakaisagana dagiti urbun na karnero ama idaton itipaskwa.

10
00:01:09,100 --> 00:01:11,360
Imbauni Jesus da Pedro, Ken Juan.

11
00:01:12,120 --> 00:01:14,900
Inkayisagana tipang rabi itayo itipaskwa.

12
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:16,900
Kinunana kadakwada.

13
00:01:17,740 --> 00:01:20,200
Sa dino tikayat mo apangisaganaan mi?

14
00:01:20,960 --> 00:01:22,060
Sinalud sudda.

15
00:01:22,880 --> 00:01:23,560
Dengganyo.

16
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:24,920
Kinunana.

17
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:27,800
Apaman asumrek kay itisudad.

18
00:01:28,780 --> 00:01:30,000
Sabdan na kay to timanay.

19
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,240
May sa alalaki anakawit itisangakaramba adanom.

20
00:01:34,060 --> 00:01:35,980
Surutin niyo itibalay asirkan na.

21
00:01:36,860 --> 00:01:38,480
Kat kunayo itiakimbalay.

22
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:41,640
Pasalud sudd ti maestro.

23
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:47,780
Nusa dino tikwarto apanganan danto kadagiti adalan na itipang rabi itipaskwa.

24
00:01:49,360 --> 00:01:52,320
Ipakitan nanto ti akin nga to akwarto adakkel.

25
00:01:52,940 --> 00:01:55,100
Kanadaan amin amasapsapol.

26
00:01:56,660 --> 00:01:58,600
Sadyay tipagsaganaan niyo.

27
00:01:58,600 --> 00:02:02,880
Napandangarod kat nasarakanda amin nga imbaga ni Jesus.

28
00:02:03,520 --> 00:02:06,800
Insagana dati pang rabi iti apang rambak itipaskwa.

29
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:13,660
Dimten ti oras kat simango ni Jesus kendag iti apostoles na itipanganan.

30
00:02:14,340 --> 00:02:19,340
Tinarigagayak unay ti makisango kadakayo itidaytoy apang rabi itipaskwa.

31
00:02:20,140 --> 00:02:21,580
Sakbay ngagsagabaak.

32
00:02:22,220 --> 00:02:23,420
Kinunana kadakwada.

33
00:02:24,240 --> 00:02:25,300
Taibagak kadakayo.

34
00:02:25,300 --> 00:02:27,620
Ajak tunmangan itidaytoy.

35
00:02:27,620 --> 00:02:32,420
Iagingga amatong paltipod no akaipapanan na itipagaryan ti Diyos.

36
00:02:33,080 --> 00:02:34,380
Nangala itikopa.

37
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:36,580
Nagyaman iti Diyos.

38
00:02:36,960 --> 00:02:37,740
Ket kinunan.

39
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:39,660
Alaen niyo daytoy.

40
00:02:40,020 --> 00:02:41,300
Ket pagbibingayan niyo.

41
00:02:42,360 --> 00:02:44,380
Ibagak kadakayo amanipod ita.

42
00:02:45,660 --> 00:02:48,420
Jakton uminom itidaytoy tubog ti ubas.

43
00:02:49,040 --> 00:02:51,580
Agingga adumten tipagaryan ti Diyos.

44
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:56,320
Nangalamat ititinapay kat kalpasan tipanagyaman na iti Diyos.

45
00:02:56,320 --> 00:02:59,320
Pinisinasaan na itid kadakwada akunana.

46
00:03:00,740 --> 00:03:04,320
Daitoy tibagik ama itid niya agpaay kadakayo.

47
00:03:05,060 --> 00:03:07,620
Aramidin niyo daytoy apang laglagip kanya.

48
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:10,780
Kastamot akalpasan tipanang rabi i,

49
00:03:11,400 --> 00:03:13,940
itid na kadakwada itikopa kat kinunana.

50
00:03:14,780 --> 00:03:18,700
Daytoy itikopa tibaro apan nakitulag ti Diyos kadakayo.

51
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:23,680
Ama patalgadan itidara ama ibuyat para kadakayo.

52
00:03:23,680 --> 00:03:25,980
Ngam kitaan niyo.

53
00:03:26,320 --> 00:03:30,320
At daditoy akalang lang langkot ita o amanglipot kanya.

54
00:03:31,700 --> 00:03:35,380
Matay to ti anak ita o kas inkadem ti Diyos.

55
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:40,420
Ngam asipay dayta at tao amanglipot kenkuana.

56
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:43,460
Nagsisin na ludso digiti apostoles.

57
00:03:43,920 --> 00:03:46,580
Nusiasin no kadakwada iti mga aramid itikasta.

58
00:03:47,520 --> 00:03:49,360
Nagsusupyat digiti adalan.

59
00:03:49,760 --> 00:03:52,900
Nusiasin no kadakwada iti mabigbig akang runaan.

60
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:55,080
Kinunan ni Jesus kadakwada.

61
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,080
Adipoy.

62
00:03:56,320 --> 00:03:59,360
Ngunan dagiti arari ahentil dagiti tatawda.

63
00:04:00,180 --> 00:04:04,880
Kat panaganan dagiti agtuturay dagiti bagbagida akas managparabor.

64
00:04:06,200 --> 00:04:08,140
Ngam saan akas takuma kadakayo?

65
00:04:09,340 --> 00:04:14,560
Nudikit agbalin ti kang runaan kadakayo akasla iso ti kaubingan.

66
00:04:15,720 --> 00:04:19,220
Kat agbalin ti pangulo akasla iso ti adipen.

67
00:04:20,360 --> 00:04:21,940
Siya sino ay atinaturturay?

68
00:04:22,940 --> 00:04:24,420
Ti sumango iti panganan?

69
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:25,660
Ngunan?

70
00:04:25,660 --> 00:04:26,900
Ano ti mang serbikin kuwana?

71
00:04:27,960 --> 00:04:29,740
Saan aya ati maserbian?

72
00:04:30,860 --> 00:04:34,880
Ngam at daak kadakayo akas may sa ngaagserbi.

73
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:40,320
Nagtalinaid kayo asipupod no kanyak kadagiti amin anakasootak.

74
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:41,920
Ngarod.

75
00:04:43,180 --> 00:04:46,940
Kas itipan ng ted kanyak ni amak itikalintagan ni agturay.

76
00:04:48,220 --> 00:04:51,760
Ited kong tumet kadakayo ti isumet laang akalintagan.

77
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:53,840
Mangan.

78
00:04:53,840 --> 00:04:57,740
Ken uminom kayo ito itilamisaan ko itipagaryak.

79
00:04:58,580 --> 00:05:05,080
Ken agtugaw kayo kadakiti trono amang ituray kadakiti sa nga puluket doa tribo ti Israel.

80
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:06,400
Simon.

81
00:05:07,380 --> 00:05:07,940
Simon.

82
00:05:08,920 --> 00:05:09,420
Denggem.

83
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:17,940
Napalubusan ni satanas amang sagat kadakayo akas itiman nalon amang itaep ititrigo.

84
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:21,180
Tatno mapaglasin tinaimbag itidakes.

85
00:05:21,960 --> 00:05:22,180
Ngam.

86
00:05:22,180 --> 00:05:24,280
Ngam inkarkararagan ka.

87
00:05:25,960 --> 00:05:26,380
Simon.

88
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:29,580
Tap no saan amapukaw tipang matim.

89
00:05:30,780 --> 00:05:32,280
Inton agsubli ka kanyak.

90
00:05:33,480 --> 00:05:36,420
Masapol apapigsaem dagiti kakabsat mo.

91
00:05:37,140 --> 00:05:37,640
Apo.

92
00:05:38,700 --> 00:05:39,900
Insumbat ni Simon.

93
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:44,620
Sisa saganak ama ibalod ken matay ama ikuyog ken ka.

94
00:05:45,440 --> 00:05:46,920
Ibagak ken ka, Pedro.

95
00:05:47,740 --> 00:05:48,620
Kinunani, Jesus.

96
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:51,780
Dintupay agdaraok ti kawitan.

97
00:05:51,780 --> 00:05:52,640
Itangal daw.

98
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:56,580
Namitluntun nga imbagam, adinak amam mo.

99
00:05:57,300 --> 00:06:03,400
Idiimbaon kayo nga awan intugot yu asupot, wen no bayon, wen no sapatos yu.

100
00:06:04,060 --> 00:06:05,760
Kinunani, Jesus, kadakwada.

101
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:09,040
Adda ayaan nyaman anagkurangan nyo.

102
00:06:09,780 --> 00:06:10,300
Awan.

103
00:06:11,060 --> 00:06:11,920
Insumbat da.

104
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:13,340
Ngam ita.

105
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,200
Kinunani, Jesus.

106
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:19,500
Tisya sino man nga adasupot na, alaan na.

107
00:06:20,140 --> 00:06:21,420
Kastamet tibayon na.

108
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:24,100
Ti awan kampilan na.

109
00:06:25,220 --> 00:06:27,800
Ila kunat ti kagay na, ket gumatang.

110
00:06:29,300 --> 00:06:34,660
Taibagak kada kayo ama sapol ama tungpal kanyak, ti kunat ti nasantuan asurat.

111
00:06:35,860 --> 00:06:37,860
Ket na ibilang kadagiti kriminal.

112
00:06:39,060 --> 00:06:39,380
Wen.

113
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:44,620
Umasidegan ti panna katungpal, ti naisurat maipapan kanyak.

114
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:48,060
Adto itidwa akampilan, apu.

115
00:06:48,940 --> 00:06:50,240
Kinunadagiti adalan.

116
00:06:50,780 --> 00:06:51,060
Isunan.

117
00:06:51,780 --> 00:06:54,860
Insumbat ni Jesus.

118
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:57,700
Rimuar ni Jesus itisidad.

119
