168
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:43,840
Pinirang na sana kinuna.

169
00:09:44,340 --> 00:09:47,560
Nakikagkadwamet day to yatao, kine Jesus.

170
00:09:48,160 --> 00:09:50,940
Babae, jak amam mo day taatao.

171
00:09:51,500 --> 00:09:52,760
Inlibak ni Pedro.

172
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:57,420
