173
00:09:58,140 --> 00:09:59,560
May sakamat kadakwada.

174
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:01,620
Kinunanang kin Pedro.

175
00:10:02,300 --> 00:10:03,900
Ngamsing mong bat ni Pedro.

176
00:10:04,760 --> 00:10:06,360
