179
00:10:13,160 --> 00:10:17,320
Tagagalilyamat day to yatao kat awan dwadwa akadwa ni Jesus.

180
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:19,720
Jak amot isa sawan.

181
00:10:20,340 --> 00:10:21,480
Insumbat ni Pedro.

182
00:10:22,160 --> 00:10:23,160
Pagamuan,

183
