189
00:10:37,140 --> 00:10:40,040
Sakbay nga daraog ti kawitan itang aldaw.

190
00:10:41,220 --> 00:10:42,740
Namit lunton niya imbagam

191
00:10:42,740 --> 00:10:44,240
at tinak amam mo.

192
00:10:44,980 --> 00:10:46,080
Rimuar ni Pedro

193
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:47,980
kat nagsangit itinasaam.

194
00:10:48,940 --> 00:10:49,860
Kabayatan na

195
00:10:49,860 --> 00:10:51,280
