196
00:10:51,280 --> 00:10:53,080
Di pa nang rabrabak

197
00:10:53,080 --> 00:10:54,400
kan panangkabgabil

198
00:10:54,400 --> 00:10:55,680
dagitin mang gwargwarda

199
00:10:55,680 --> 00:10:56,280
ken kuwana.

200
00:10:57,180 --> 00:10:58,300
Inabungutan da

201
00:10:58,300 --> 00:10:59,700
