ken ka?

205
00:11:03,780 --> 00:11:05,160
Adupay ti sinauda

206
00:11:05,160 --> 00:11:06,320
apang papabain

207
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:07,020
ken kuwana.

208
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:09,020
Idi bumigatan

209
00:11:09,020 --> 00:11:11,740
