210
00:11:11,740 --> 00:11:12,540
dagitihudyo.

211
00:11:13,580 --> 00:11:14,700
Dagitipang uluan

212
00:11:14,700 --> 00:11:15,300
apapadi

213
00:11:15,300 --> 00:11:17,420
kan dagitimamaistro

214
00:11:17,420 --> 00:11:18,200
itilintag.

215
00:11:19,100 --> 00:11:20,820
Kat naidatag ni Jesus

216
00:11:20,820 --> 00:11:21,920
itisanhed rin

217
00:11:21,920 --> 00:11:23,440
apang kumanda.

218
00:11:24,140 --> 00:11:25,360
Ibagaman kada kami

219
00:11:25,360 --> 00:11:26,380
no sikat ni Kristo.

220
00:11:27,100 --> 00:11:27,740
Kinunada

221
00:11:27,740 --> 00:11:29,800
